new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e43b933
--- /dev/null
+++ b/demos/juice.dem
@@ -0,0 +1,50 @@
+# juice.dem — Story 7.1's launchable golden: the JUICED frame (the top-down
+# sprite family + the tier-band pipes + doorstep queues + the live telegraph),
+# pinned at two moments: 30000ms = the calm busy neighborhood (the 7.1 look
+# at its best: 4 routers basic/mid/high, 7 houses, 2 hosts, all three pipe
+# tiers + a 2-member bundle, two QoS weight presets, live era-3 traffic, the
+# forecast counting down); 65000ms = the surge moment. The health meter is
+# DELIBERATELY off: on this richer map the surge drains the meter to terminal
+# before the capture, freezing the crisis out of the frame — the meter's
+# golden is the health_*/surge demos; this golden pins the crisis moment.
+# (the crisis banner + the bottleneck outline on the narrow uplink — the
+# juiced telegraph). Deterministic by construction (seed + logged commands —
+# the T1 manifest + the replay gate pin the timeline like every demo).
+#
+# The map is the Phase-A probe scene (the user-approved composition), lowered
+# to demo verbs. All spans tier-legal at authoring time (narrow <= 10,
+# standard <= 14, wide <= 18).
+seed 7
+run 70000ms
+era 3
+fixture off
+spawn_node residential 4 6
+spawn_node residential 7 12
+spawn_node residential 3 17
+spawn_node residential 10 21
+spawn_node residential 15 24
+spawn_node residential 27 23
+spawn_node residential 35 13
+spawn_node router_basic 8 9
+spawn_node router_mid 16 15
+spawn_node router_high 25 10
+spawn_node router_basic 28 17
+spawn_node content_host 31 6
+spawn_node content_host 33 20
+at 100ms draw 0 7 narrow
+at 100ms draw 1 7 narrow
+at 100ms draw 2 8 standard
+at 100ms draw 3 8 standard
+at 100ms draw 4 8 narrow
+at 100ms draw 7 8 standard
+at 100ms draw 7 8 standard
+at 100ms draw 8 9 wide
+at 100ms draw 9 11 wide
+at 100ms draw 9 10 standard
+at 100ms draw 10 12 standard
+at 100ms draw 5 10 narrow
+at 100ms draw 6 10 narrow
+at 100ms emphasis 7 express_heavy
+at 100ms emphasis 2 best_effort_heavy
+capture at 30000ms
+capture at 65000ms
